@startuml
' Reservation subdiagram
title Describe reservation and calculate price
autonumber
hide footbox
actor Customer as User
control "controller : ReservationController" as Controller
participant "category : CarType" as Category
participant "insurance : Insurance" as Insurance
participant "option : ExtraOption" as Option
User -> Controller : searchOffers(location, dates)
Controller -> Controller : findAvailableOffers(location, dates)
note right of Controller : Availability and tariff lookup details omitted.
Controller --> User : available offers
User -> Controller : selectCategory(category)
Controller -> Category : getDetails()
Category --> Controller : category details
Controller --> User : details, included coverage and available extras
User -> Controller : selectExtras(insurances, options)
loop Each additional insurance
Controller -> Insurance : getPricePerDay()
Insurance --> Controller : daily price
end
loop Each selected option
Controller -> Option : getPrice()
Option --> Controller : option price
end
User -> Controller : selectPaymentOption(paymentOption)
Controller -> Controller : calculateQuote(selection, tariffs)
Controller --> User : selection summary and quotedPrice
note over Controller, Option
Pricing and offer lookup are proposed responsibilities.
Included insurance adds no extra charge.
Prepay tariff is lower than pay-at-pickup.
end note
@enduml
